{"id":"vod_jy_115407","vodId":"115407","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"天是红河岸","name_cn":"天是红河岸","date":"2026-01-01","year":"2026","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第16集","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/dd23b42b2891e93c25e72f159932a294.jpg"},"summary":"日本国中女生铃木夕梨被咒术牵引至纪元前的赫梯帝国，并长期遭受娜姬雅王后的追杀，目的在于以她为祭品咒杀凯鲁王子。在凯鲁的庇护与指导下，夕梨从误打误撞开始学习成长，到最后能够与王太后在政治舞台上一较高下，其强大的行动力以及敏锐卓越的决策能力，被凯鲁和部下认定为唯一的王后人选。历经凯鲁登基为王、放弃回日本、多次被掳、流产以及政治斗争之后，娜姬雅终于自王宫中被排除，由夕梨登上后位继承达瓦安娜的名号，与凯鲁两人共同创造盛世。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画,日本动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-10-21 18:58:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":16,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bo2jA7ja/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/e5yRA0xe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dBBPjv2d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dL9vrLpe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/egJnwold/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/elY7xk6a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/eXD5n08e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/eXD5lKme/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/epY20Dya/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/b2kWnXKd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/eVON7qOa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dG69Xo8b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dyPm4Gnb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dG69LK0b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/en5YRkRd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dwpEyLre/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T21:38:45.973Z"}